    "Under workflow auto, fresh stateless Firefox visits to canonical www.lowes.com product URLs use the public homepage search form and a URL-derived numeric product identifier.",
    "The observed search GET redirects to the requested product. No homepage, results page, foreign origin or different product is accepted as a ready product capture.",
    "A five-second passive settle before Enter stays inside the original caller deadline. Retained sessions, explicit actions and other engines keep their existing paths.",
    "Final navigation honors load or domcontentloaded and the caller navigation cap. The workflow rechecks the caller deadline after settling and before Enter; native operations are awaited.",
    "The API extends its existing requested-product identity check and closed stateless alternate eligibility to this recognized storefront; no additional engine stage or client retry is added."
  ],
